# What `gcloud builds submit` must NOT upload.
#
# This file completely replaces .gitignore for that upload — once a
# .gcloudignore exists gcloud stops consulting .gitignore — so every
# exclusion that matters has to be repeated here. The .env rules are the
# reason this file is explicit rather than absent: a source upload sends the
# working directory, and .env.local holds the database password and the OAuth
# client secret.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.git/
.gitignore

node_modules/
.next/
out/
build/

# The app's own build inputs — the ingest image needs package.json,
# package-lock.json, tsconfig.json, scripts/ and lib/ and nothing else.
# These are excluded to keep the upload small, not for secrecy.
app/
components/
public/
drizzle/
.github/
*.md
backups/
